{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "JOB",
  "chapter": 35,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JOB.35.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.35.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Elihu spoke moreover, and said,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.35.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.35.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thinkest thou this to be right, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thou saidst, My righteousness ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " more than God's?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.35.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.35.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For thou saidst, What advantage will it be to thee? ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", What profit shall I have, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "if I be cleansed",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " from my sin?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.35.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.35.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will answer thee, and thy companions with thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.35.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.35.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Look to the heavens, and see; and behold the clouds ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "which",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " are higher than thou.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.35.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.35.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If thou sinnest, what doest thou against him? or ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "if",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy transgressions are multiplied, what doest thou to him?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.35.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.35.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If thou art righteous, what givest thou to him? or what receiveth he from thy hand?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.35.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.35.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thy wickedness ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "may hurt",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a man as thou ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "art",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ": and thy righteousness ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "may profit",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the son of man.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.35.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.35.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "By reason of the multitude of oppressions they make ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the oppressed",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to cry: they cry out by reason of the arm of the mighty.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.35.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.35.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But none saith, Where ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " God my maker, who giveth songs in the night;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.35.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.35.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who teacheth us more than the beasts of the earth, and maketh us wiser than the fowls of heaven?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.35.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.35.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There they cry, but none giveth answer, because of the pride of evil men.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.35.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.35.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Surely God will not hear vanity, neither will the Almighty regard it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.35.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.35.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Although thou sayest thou shalt not see him, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "yet",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " judgment ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " before him; therefore trust thou in him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.35.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.35.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But now, because ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "so",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", he hath visited in his anger; yet he knoweth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not in great extremity:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.35.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.35.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore doth Job open his mouth in vain; he multiplieth words without knowledge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
